  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "The novel names star path as a cultivation path with mortal and immortal killer moves, Immortal Gu, and a venerable specialty lineage, not as mere star imagery.",
      "chapters": [],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "no_citation",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_immortal_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "In treasure yellow heaven, Star Lord Wan Xiang sells star path killer moves after Fang Yuan buys starlight firefly Gu. Three listed moves are dazzling star armor (defensive full-body starlight armor), spring star rain (jade rain that nurtures crops and manages a blessed land), and spiral drill star spear (offensive). Killer-move listings stay vague on exact Gu counts and activation sequences until after purchase. Prices track rarity, flaws, power, backlash, counters, and the Gu worms required. Fang Yuan buys spring star rain and enough star shoot Gu for ten activations, treating that plant-nurturing move as the piece he needs for immortal aperture management.",
      "chapters": [
        667
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "what-the-path-governs",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_star_lord_wan_xiang",
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "sys_killer_moves",
        "sys_gu_worms",
        "gu_star_shoot_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Tu Shi Cheng places Star Constellation Immortal Venerable as the creator of wisdom path and star path in the Remote Antiquity Era.",
      "chapters": [
        1323
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "star-constellation-founding",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_tu_shi_cheng",
        "char_star_constellation_immortal_venerable",
        "evt_era_remote"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "After exhausting dream realms, Fang Yuan’s listed attainments include star path at grandmaster, in the same band as blood path, strength path, formation path, soul path, and sword path.",
      "chapters": [
        2154
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "fang-yuan-grandmaster",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Giant Sun Immortal Venerable tells Star Constellation Immortal Venerable that she cultivates wisdom path primarily with star path as her secondary path.",
      "chapters": [
        2203
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "star-constellation-specialty",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_giant_sun_immortal_venerable"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "A later stretch repeats that she cultivated wisdom path and star path, and that venerables often keep one path primary and widely spread while sealing the specialty path more tightly. Her case is wisdom path primary with star path as specialty.",
      "chapters": [
        2204
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "star-constellation-specialty",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    }
